<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan gold prices seen falling.</title>
<headline>Pakistan gold prices seen falling.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan gold prices are expected to fall in this week in line with lower international prices, dealers said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;Pakistan gold prices depend on international gold markets where prices have fallen in the last few days,&quot; dealer Farooq Qureshi said.</p>
<p>    Gold 24 carat in rupees per 10 grammes SUNDAY   March 2</p>
<p>							 4,702    4,895</p>
<p>    Silver per 1,000 grammes		   7,715    7,715</p>
<p>($1 = 40.22 rupees) -- Ibrahim Khan 9221-5685192</p>
